        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium casting, plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium casting, plant
Medium sized plant. Output: 130'000 t/a, life time: 50 years. Site is shared with electrolysis plant. Total land use is allocated 50% to electrolysis, 50% to casting.;
UUID: 570c1c6d-665e-328f-a7dd-a9be1c507255
Production hall, machinery and administrative buildings (including disposal)
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Technology of one medium sized plant in Norway
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_570c1c6d-665e-328f-a7dd-a9be1c507255.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
